content-briefs/gastric-sleeve-perth.md-134-### Cost paragraph
content-briefs/gastric-sleeve-perth.md-135-Cover these points in a single flowing paragraph (not a list):
content-briefs/gastric-sleeve-perth.md:136:- Total cost varies depending on private health cover, surgeon and anaesthetist fees, hospital charges and any out-of-pocket gap.
content-briefs/gastric-sleeve-perth.md:137:- Signal honesty about cost upfront — uncertainty about money is a major source of stress.
content-briefs/gastric-sleeve-perth.md:138:- Medicare item number 31575 attracts a rebate when eligibility criteria are met.
content-briefs/gastric-sleeve-perth.md:139:- Private health insurance with appropriate hospital cover may contribute to hospital and theatre costs; benefits, waiting periods and gaps depend on the policy and fund.
content-briefs/gastric-sleeve-perth.md:140:- A cost guide breaks down components and funding options including private health insurance and early-access superannuation for eligible cases.
content-briefs/gastric-sleeve-perth.md-141-- Do not quote a single dollar figure.
