content-briefs/gastric-sleeve-perth.md-146-Direction: Empathetic and action-oriented without pressure. Acknowledge the reader has been carrying this for a long time, and frame the next step as a conversation about fit — not a commitment. Something in the spirit of: "You have carried this long enough. Let's talk about whether a gastric sleeve is the right next step for you."
