content-reviews/gastric-sleeve-perth.md-46-
content-reviews/gastric-sleeve-perth.md:47:> Draft L57-L61: Gastric sleeve surgery is highly effective for weight loss for two key reasons: first, because your stomach is smaller, you feel fuller, faster. Secondly, because a reduced stomach size minimises your body’s production of ghrelin (the ‘hunger hormone’), after gastric sleeve surgery, your appetite will also be reduced.
content-reviews/gastric-sleeve-perth.md-48-
content-reviews/gastric-sleeve-perth.md:49:> The operation reduces stomach capacity, which may help some people feel full with smaller portions. It also removes part of the stomach that produces much of the body’s ghrelin, a hormone involved in hunger, so appetite changes vary between people in degree and duration.
content-reviews/gastric-sleeve-perth.md-50-
content-reviews/gastric-sleeve-perth.md-51-Why it matters: "Will also be reduced" reads like an outcome guarantee, while the rewrite keeps the mechanism and qualifies individual variation.
