content-reviews/gastric-sleeve-perth.md:63:> Draft L307-L315: **7. Does Medicare cover gastric sleeve surgery?** Medicare item number 31575 attracts a rebate when eligibility criteria are met, offsetting part of the surgical fee. However, Medicare alone doesn't cover the full cost and hospital, theatre, and anaesthetist fees still apply. Private health insurance with a gold-tier (or equivalent) policy will cover the hospital component. A full fee breakdown is available to help you understand your out-of-pocket costs.
content-reviews/gastric-sleeve-perth.md-64-
content-reviews/gastric-sleeve-perth.md:65:> **7. Does Medicare cover gastric sleeve surgery?** Medicare item 31575 may attract a rebate when the MBS requirements are met, but Medicare does not cover every fee. Hospital, theatre, surgeon and anaesthetist costs, private-health benefits and out-of-pocket gaps depend on your circumstances and policy, so confirm current details with your surgeon’s office and insurer. A consultation can help you understand which costs and rebates apply to you.
